    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/full-stac/full-stac",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/full-stac"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Full-STAC",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Full-STAC",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Full-STAC",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Full-STAC",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Full-STAC",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Full-STAC",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:altLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Full-STAC",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "full-STAC",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "full-STAC approach",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "full-STAC remedy",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Together, open Standards, open Technologies, open Architectures and open Content represent a next-generation ‘full-STAC’ remedy for digital health transformation.",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "تمثل المعايير المفتوحة والتكنولوجيات المفتوحة والبنى المفتوحة والمحتوى المفتوح مجتمعةً علاجًا من الجيل التالي يُعرف بـ «full-STAC» للتحول في مجال الصحة الرقمية.",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "En conjunto, los Estándares abiertos, las Tecnologías abiertas, las Arquitecturas abiertas y el Contenido abierto representan una solución ‘full-STAC’ de nueva generación para la transformación de la salud digital.",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Ensemble, les normes ouvertes, les technologies ouvertes, les architectures ouvertes et les contenus ouverts constituent une solution « full-STAC » de nouvelle génération pour la transformation de la santé numérique.",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Вместе открытые стандарты, открытые технологии, открытые архитектуры и открытый контент представляют собой средство нового поколения — «full-STAC» — для цифровой трансформации здравоохранения.",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "开放标准（open Standards）、开放技术（open Technologies）、开放架构（open Architectures）和开放内容（open Content）共同构成数字卫生转型的新一代“full-STAC”解决方案。",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skosxl:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/full-stac/full-stac#label-ar"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/full-stac/full-stac#label-es"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/full-stac/full-stac#label-fr"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/full-stac/full-stac#label-ru"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/full-stac/full-stac#label-zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "Full-STAC",
      "skos:scopeNote": "Quoted from the abstract. The paper calls it both an approach and a remedy, and names the four as 'four factors'. The DPI-H RA draft (sec-022, footnote 14) cites this paper and presents the four as 'the enabling conditions for REDDHI'.",
      "skos:related": [
