        }
      ],
      "skos:scopeNote": "The centre of Figure 1, which the four factors surround. The paper does not define it; the nearest statements are the vision of health data that 'travels with them' and a 'standards-based longitudinal health record that supports the patient over time'. Recorded so the RA can decide whether it matches its own person-centred terms.",
      "dcterms:source": "library/mehl-2023-full-stac-oqad018/sections/sec-000-a-full-stac-remedy-for-global-digital-health-tra.md#figure-1",
      "skos:note": "could-not-extract: The paper uses the phrase but never states what it is."
    },
